    "marker": "insufficient",
    "value": "Idempotency (f(f(x))=f(x)) is the property an append-only event log must require of its writers; safety is a weaker, orthogonal property about not corrupting other operations and is insufficient alone. The exact distinction: idempotency constrains an operation's effect on itself under repeated appli"
