    "value": "The log must require a composite property \u2014 'idempotent-and-safe' \u2014 where idempotency guarantees final-state equivalence and safety guarantees no harmful intermediate states or external side-effects during retry. Neither property alone suffices if the replay system can observe intermediate states or"
